// -------------------------------------------------
// Cached copies of every scarlet_* cvar.
//
// cvar() looks the name up as a string every time it is called, and the per-frame code
// (stats, bots, shields, markers...) calls it constantly.  Instead all of them are read once
// a second into the cv_ globals below, and the rest of the code reads those.  A cvar you
// change in the console takes effect within a second.
//
// This file is generated: when you add a scarlet_ cvar, add it here and use cv_<name> in code.
// -------------------------------------------------

